          ],
          "value": "Plays a role in the establishment of normal sperm morphology during spermatogenesis and is required for acrosome attachment to the nuclear envelope"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "FUNCTION"
    },
    {
      "texts": [
        {
          "evidences": [
            {
              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "38573307"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Interacts with proteins of spermatozoa head including ACTL7A, CCIN, FAM209A and SPACA1; the interactions may be necessary for proper acrosome attachment to the nuclear envelope"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "SUBUNIT"
    },
